.TH "PB-TUNNEL-ROUTE-LIST" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-tunnel-route-list - List tunnel routes


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb tunnel route list <tunnel> [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List tunnel routes

.PP
List routes and their identifiers for one durable tunnel with pagination. Inspect the exact route before updating or removing it.

.PP
Routes map a public or private match to a specific origin and protocol. TLS and host-header options affect the trust boundary and should match the origin. Adding or updating a route may return an operation whose readiness must be checked separately.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--cursor\fP=""
	continue a previous page

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for list

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print canonical JSON

.PP
\fB--limit\fP=100
	maximum results (1-200)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--ephemeral\fP[=false]
	use the temporary preview lifecycle

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
